                 the attractor (high cos) and diverge AWAY from it. EXP-L1-01 ran one; the
                 paper's stability claim cites an experiment that ran the other."
  retraction: "An earlier session suggestion — to add a Prigogine/'environmental coupling is
               necessary' Remark from EXP-L1-01 — was PREMATURE. That collapse is an artifact
               of the phase-driven trust law, NOT a demonstrated physical fact. Do NOT write
