// ─── ARC 3 — DECISIONS FROM THE 2026-06-16e CONCEPTUAL ROUND ────────────────
// Origin: rmw3 asked to enumerate decisions from the philosophical/explanatory exchange
// that ran in parallel with ARC 1 code work (Cor_ReframeRecertification, viability-equivalence,
